    plus the batching window, so a message is not delivered again while a
    slow batch still holds it.
{{- else if $schedule }}
  - Retries at two levels. The schedule's retry policy tries again to
    invoke the function, up to 10 times within an hour, when Lambda
    throttles the call or fails; the function, invoked asynchronously,
    retries a run that threw twice within an hour (its
